# ReSource reads two env files, each with its own template:
#
#   backend/.env   copy from backend/.env.example   server-side secrets (never in the app)
#   app/.env       copy from app/.env.example       EXPO_PUBLIC_* values, which are public
#
# Both are optional. With neither file the backend runs on bundled data and the app talks to
# http://localhost:8000. Each template explains its own variables.
#
# The backend also reads this root .env, so the two values below can live here instead.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY turns on the Claude assistant in chat; empty means basic search mode.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# If set, ADMIN_TOKEN must be at least 24 characters; empty disables passcode-based admin access.
ADMIN_TOKEN=
